[SPEAKER_01]: So, 6th, 7th, The Whale Sun, Merrick kind of thinks about the day.

00:09.656 --> 00:10.956
[SPEAKER_01]: What do you think is going on?

00:11.777 --> 00:13.018
[SPEAKER_01]: What do I think about the day so far?

00:13.078 --> 00:13.298
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

00:13.838 --> 00:15.139
[SPEAKER_01]: Do you have any questions for me?

00:19.114 --> 00:23.556
