00:24.576 --> 00:25.917
[SPEAKER_00]: What's your mission?

00:26.237 --> 00:31.039
[SPEAKER_00]: I was told to go with Owen to get as much information as I could from...

00:31.439 --> 00:32.500
[SPEAKER_00]: I forgot who my leader was.

00:33.000 --> 00:33.540
[SPEAKER_01]: From Jameis.

00:33.640 --> 00:34.200
