00:34.841 --> 00:42.184
[SPEAKER_00]: To go find out as much information as I could about some stuff that was going on with the whole principalities and what's, you know... What have you figured out?

00:43.805 --> 00:44.565
[SPEAKER_00]: At this point...

00:45.752 --> 00:55.195
[SPEAKER_00]: Besides that Toli has either... he has the amulet and is controlling the... An artifact.

00:55.355 --> 00:56.895
[SPEAKER_01]: It's not an amulet, it's an artifact.

00:56.975 --> 01:04.897
[SPEAKER_00]: An artifact that's controlling these turtle dragons and blocking off our coastline, causing them the mysterious storms that we've been seeing and stuff and all this...

01:05.738 --> 01:06.738
[SPEAKER_00]: I know this information.

01:08.789 --> 01:26.295
[SPEAKER_00]: And I know that this, where we are right now, Red Shore, right, is blocked off of the brigade and kind of keeping these merchants and stuff, people here, hostile, kind of like, not hostage, but like, they don't love being here type of thing.

01:26.335 --> 01:27.155
[SPEAKER_01]: It's an embargo.

01:27.175 --> 01:30.617
[SPEAKER_01]: They're being routed here and their stores are routed.

01:30.637 --> 01:31.617
[SPEAKER_00]: The blockade, yeah.

01:32.737 --> 01:33.358
[SPEAKER_01]: And I know that.

01:35.633 --> 01:39.917
[SPEAKER_01]: And you know the Monmurgian fleet hasn't been able to break it, because why?

01:40.518 --> 01:42.920
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah, well, because they can't really get through here.

01:42.940 --> 01:44.002
[SPEAKER_00]: They don't know what's going on.

01:44.362 --> 01:52.330
[SPEAKER_00]: I mean, I feel like they wanted to go as far around as we did with Owen, but the main shot is all blocked off of the storms and all that's going on over there.

01:53.891 --> 01:54.993
[SPEAKER_00]: And anyone who's coming here

01:55.944 --> 02:00.246
[SPEAKER_00]: Probably isn't really going to leave too easily from this area.

02:00.266 --> 02:02.147
