02:23.706 --> 02:23.926
[SPEAKER_00]: Yes.

02:25.206 --> 02:26.787
[SPEAKER_00]: But it seems to be a pretty big advantage.

02:26.887 --> 02:27.327
[SPEAKER_01]: It's huge.

02:27.467 --> 02:28.167
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes.

02:28.287 --> 02:28.787
[SPEAKER_01]: It's huge.

02:30.628 --> 02:32.388
[SPEAKER_01]: But what does that tell you about Red Shore?

02:33.568 --> 02:34.289
