02:40.610 --> 02:41.190
[SPEAKER_00]: It's vulnerable.

02:42.011 --> 02:42.231
[SPEAKER_00]: Yes.

02:42.591 --> 02:43.251
[SPEAKER_00]: Vulnerable to

02:45.145 --> 02:47.906
