03:34.971 --> 03:42.693
[SPEAKER_01]: So you could literally walk up and down the coast of this place and see if there are any turtle dragons anywhere in the area.

03:42.933 --> 03:44.073
[SPEAKER_01]: Now the problem is...

03:45.588 --> 03:47.049
[SPEAKER_01]: How do you get in contact with Jameis?

03:48.290 --> 03:48.470
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

03:50.811 --> 03:52.152
