04:28.479 --> 04:29.080
[SPEAKER_00]: That makes sense.

04:29.640 --> 04:29.880
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay.

04:31.422 --> 04:39.288
[SPEAKER_00]: So I think my best interest is to get us off this place and report to Jameis, because we're kind of sitting ducks here.

04:41.127 --> 04:43.289
