04:51.618 --> 04:56.163
[SPEAKER_01]: Not everyone knows your face, and you can blend in, but there are spies everywhere.

04:56.784 --> 05:02.550
[SPEAKER_01]: And if there was somebody that was told to look out for four dudes, and one of them is a hard-drinking gouge... Yeah.

