05:14.199 --> 05:15.301
[SPEAKER_01]: Discreet, either.

05:15.321 --> 05:16.143
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

05:16.343 --> 05:17.405
[SPEAKER_01]: So...

05:17.465 --> 05:18.527
[SPEAKER_01]: Okay.

05:19.488 --> 05:19.769
